        "id": 15838,
        "name": "Rudra no Hihou",
        "summary": "In a fantasy world inspired by Indian folklore, the end of mankind draws nigh. Can you break the cycle before humanity is doomed? Up to four separate scenarios are available for players to enjoy, with a magic system that gives the player total creativity in combat!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4l1w.jpg",
