      {
        "id": 16288,
        "name": "Brain Lord",
        "summary": "ARE YOU THE BRAIN LORD?\n\nBeyond your memory lies a time filled with Dragons and men riding the skies together. The Dragon Warrior blood flows deeply through your family. Now. you are the only one left. Your father has spent a life time searching for the Ancient Dragons, a life lived in vain. It is up to you to find the Dragons. Before you lies a world filled with puzzles and riddles, enough to drive even the most 'rational insane.\n\nThere are too many unanswered questions in your mind. What lies ahead? Where do I start? What will I find? There is a Dark Presence that awaits you. Can you unlock the secret? Are you strong enough to survive?\n\nARE YOU A BRAIN LORD?\nWe shall see...",
